,"kind":"person","person_id":"8b2_aac_6d7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本完整敘事與對話scope辨識，不用nearest規則。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit004:m0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"鑿齒","kind":"person","person_id":"8b2_aac_6d7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本完整敘事與對話scope辨識，不用nearest規則。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-028-wangling:unit004:m0236","start":236,"end":237,"surface":"自","kind":"person","person_id":"8b2_aac_6d7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"逐字句域判讀；非最近人物推定。"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-028-wangling","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-028","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-028-wangling"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022-pei01-01","text":"习凿齿曰：张昭於是乎不臣矣！夫臣人者，三谏不从则奉身而退，身苟不绝，何忿懟之有？且秦穆违谏，卒霸西戎，晋文暂怒，终成大业。遗誓以悔过见录，狐偃无怨绝之辞，君臣道泰，上下俱荣。今权悔往之非而求昭，后益回虑降心，不远而复，是其善也。昭为人臣，不度权得道，匡其后失，夙夜匪懈，以延来誉，乃追忿不用，归罪於君，闭户拒命，坐待焚灭，岂不悖哉！","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022-pei01-01:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"习凿齿","kind":"person","person_id":"8b2_aac_6d7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022-pei01-01:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"张昭","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022-pei01-01:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"秦穆","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022-pei01-01:m0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"晋文","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022-pei01-01:m0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"狐偃","kind":"person","person_id":"xxq_5y6_8sr